  "description": "A two-handed maul slam: the caster hauls a heavy iron-headed maul up over their head, holds it, then drives it straight down onto the enemy in front. The ground caves into a crater, a hard shockwave and a rolling wall of dust ring out from the hit, rock heaves up and everyone close by is blown off their feet.",
