      "side": "Hero for the swing: the tall heavy fall of the maul head and the rock and dust jumping up where it lands.",
      "top": "Hero for the area: the crater, then two rings rolling out from the hit through the group, a sharp one then a slow dust wall.",
      "three_quarter": "The heave, the fall, the crater, both shockwaves and the group thrown clear all read."
    }
